## 🚀 How to Run

### 1. Start Flask backend (unchanged)
```bash
# In solar_app_v4/
python app.py
# Runs on http://localhost:5000
```

### 2. Start React frontend
```bash
cd react_frontend
npm install     # already done
npm run dev     # runs on http://localhost:5173
```

> API calls to `/api/*` are **proxied** to `localhost:5000` via [vite.config.ts](file:///d:/All%20projects/PM%20Surya%20Ghar%20Yojana/1.%20prototypes/solar_app_v4/react_frontend/vite.config.ts) — no CORS issues.

