## 🎯 What's Preserved Identically

- ✅ All animations (float, glowPulse, colorShift, technoSweep, rocket thrust)
- ✅ Dark mode (localStorage + OS preference + body class toggle)
- ✅ Benefit carousel auto-rotation + dot navigation
- ✅ ArcGIS satellite map with click-to-select and geocoding
- ✅ ArcGIS 3D SceneView with altitude/tilt readout and scene controls
- ✅ Roboflow API call flow (`/api/analyze-location`)
- ✅ JSON download, save-to-database, new-analysis reset
- ✅ Subsidy live calculation formula (state multipliers)
- ✅ Formspree form submission + success/error messages
- ✅ Ably real-time chat, history loading, username in localStorage
- ✅ 6-step flowchart with animated arrow connectors
- ✅ All responsive breakpoints (md, lg grid layouts)
- ✅ Floating home button with pulse-glow animation
